R223	Cueing Arg1:T209 Arg2:T208	
R224	Speaker Arg1:T210 Arg2:T208	
T211	Quotation 46375 46533	"Have you no fear of God, Ivan Ivanitch? You will compel me to hide your caps and lock the door! You must have a cup of tea and a snack of something, anyway."
