T228	Entity 48082 48092	Kuzmitchov
T229	Cue 48115 48120	asked
T230	Quotation 48122 48212	"Solomon, why did you not come to our fair at N. this summer, and act some Jewish scenes?"
R246	Speaker Arg1:T228 Arg2:T230	
R247	Cueing Arg1:T229 Arg2:T230	
T231	Entity 47999 48002	his
R248	Addressee Arg1:T231 Arg2:T230	
T233	Quotation 49140 49184	"I wish you a good appetite! Tea and sugar!"
T234	Entity 49185 49187	he
T232	Cue 49188 49193	began
R249	Speaker Arg1:T234 Arg2:T233	
R250	Cueing Arg1:T232 Arg2:T233	
T235	Quotation 49229 49398	"I hope you will enjoy it. Such rare guests, such rare ones; it is years since I last saw Father Christopher. And will no one tell me who is this nice little gentleman?"
T236	Entity 49215 49227	his visitors
R251	Addressee Arg1:T236 Arg2:T233	
T237	Entity 49399 49401	he
T238	Cue 49402 49407	asked
R252	Speaker Arg1:T237 Arg2:T235	
R253	Cueing Arg1:T238 Arg2:T235	
R254	Addressee Arg1:T236 Arg2:T235	
