R255	Cueing Arg1:T240 Arg2:T239	
R256	Speaker Arg1:T241 Arg2:T239	
R257	Addressee Arg1:T237 Arg2:T239	
T242	Quotation 49507 49531	"And where is he going?"
R258	Speaker Arg1:T237 Arg2:T242	
R259	Addressee Arg1:T241 Arg2:T242	
