T385	Entity 63768 63771	him
R431	Speaker Arg1:T383 Arg2:T382	
R432	Cueing Arg1:T384 Arg2:T382	
R433	Addressee Arg1:T385 Arg2:T382	
T386	Quotation 63773 63929	"If you don't like your religion you had better change it, but to laugh at it is a sin; it is only the lowest of the low who will make fun of his religion."
R434	Speaker Arg1:T383 Arg2:T386	
R435	Cueing Arg1:T384 Arg2:T386	
R436	Addressee Arg1:T385 Arg2:T386	
