T388	Entity 63954 63961	Solomon
T389	Quotation 63984 64056	"I am talking of one thing and you are talking of something else. . . ."
R437	Speaker Arg1:T388 Arg2:T387	
R438	Speaker Arg1:T388 Arg2:T389	
R439	Addressee Arg1:T383 Arg2:T387	
R440	Addressee Arg1:T383 Arg2:T389	
