R442	Speaker Arg1:T392 Arg2:T390	
T393	Quotation 64124 64316	"I admonish you to the best of my ability, and you are angry. I speak to you like an old man quietly, and you answer like a turkeycock: 'Bla-- bla-- bla!' You really are a queer fellow. . . ."
