T456	Entity 72587 72589	he
T457	Cue 72590 72594	said
T458	Quotation 72596 72787	"But doesn't that Kazimir Mihalovitch plunder her right and left! The year before last when, do you remember, I bought some wool from her, he made over three thousand from my purchase alone."
R513	Cueing Arg1:T457 Arg2:T458	
R514	Speaker Arg1:T456 Arg2:T458	
T459	Quotation 72788 72837	"That is just what you would expect from a Pole,"
